                <head>217. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On June 20, 1961, Secretary Rusk held several conversations with Japanese
                    officials on a number of topics regarding U.S.-Japanese relations. One of these
                    conversations on liberalization of trade and payments is scheduled for
                    publication in <ref target="frus:frus1961-63v22">volume XXII</ref>.</p>
            </div>
